      "speaker_notes": "El testing dentro del pipeline DevOps.",
      "html_content": "<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template:auto 1fr / repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; height:100%;\">\n  <div style=\"grid-column:1/-1; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--card-bg-from), var(--card-bg-to)); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius:var(--card-radius); padding:24px 32px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:24px;\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:var(--display-font); font-size:36px; color:var(--text-primary); margin:8px 0;\">Integración Continua (CI/CD)</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--card-bg-from); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius:var(--card-radius); padding:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\"><p style=\"font-size:32px; color:var(--accent-1);\">01</p><h3 style=\"color:var(--text-primary);\">Precisión</h3></div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--card-bg-from); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius:var(--card-radius); padding:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\"><p style=\"font-size:32px; color:var(--accent-2);\">02</p><h3 style=\"color:var(--text-primary);\">Velocidad</h3></div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"background:var(--card-bg-from); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius:var(--card-radius); padding:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\"><p style=\"font-size:32px; color:var(--accent-3);\">03</p><h3 style=\"color:var(--text-primary);\">Cobertura</h3></div>\n</div>"
